  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>雙持巨劍</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這是 Epicfight 模組的附加組件。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">它讓你能夠雙持巨劍！</span> </span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/957668669054410762/1003973381231755384/2022-08-02_12.21.20.png\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你只需要學習被動技能書，就會獲得全新的四種雙持自動攻擊、三種雙手自動攻擊、一種新的衝刺攻擊、新的跳躍攻擊和新的特殊攻擊！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">還有新的威嚇性待機、行走和奔跑動畫。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/957668669054410762/1003976679363969034/unknown.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"532\" height=\"378\"><br>祝您玩得開心！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">原始構想來自 Ralf ^^。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">（為了與 Weapons of Minecraft Patreon 相容，請確保 [mod:efdg]（雙持巨劍資料包）位於 [mod:wom]（Weapons of Minecraft 資料包）和 [mod:epicfight]（Epicfight 資料包）之間，就像這樣：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/957668669054410762/1003973485376323685/efdgWomCompat.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"623\" height=\"65\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>",
